Compute the actual elapsed time between the end of an employee's previous shift and the start of their next shift.

Support overnight timestamps and date boundaries correctly.

Example:

S3 ending at 07:00 Saturday → Saturday OFF → Sunday OFF → S2 starting Monday at 14:00 gives 55 hours of rest.

S2 ending at 23:00 Friday → Saturday OFF → Sunday OFF → S1 starting Monday at 06:30 gives 55.5 hours of rest.

Do not incorrectly flag these block transitions.

